notes               = "Untitled in source. Four lines. The mountain is measured from the cloud's point of view, which is the same trick as snow-turtledove's fifty years — scale set by the observer rather than the object. 29 Farvardin = 18 April 1991. Imported as a draft with machine / lantern layers; ===translation=== left for Ben."
draft               = true

===persian===

چه کوتاه می‌نماید
بلندترین قلهٔ جهان،
در حافظهٔ ابر،
در خاطرهٔ باران...
۱۳۷۰/۱/۲۹

===machine===

How short it looks,
the highest peak in the world,
in the memory of the cloud,
in the memory of the rain...
1370/1/29

===lantern===

How short it looks,
the highest peak on earth,
in the memory of the cloud,
in the memory of the rain...

1370/1/29

